    },
    {
      "name": "侧栏导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "独立统一顶栏与侧栏的浏览器近似：顶栏只容纳左侧收起/展开和右侧最小化、最大化、关闭，统一使用 sidebar 底色及 1px 底线；工作分区从下方开始。32px 为顶栏高度下限，侧栏展开 216px、收起 72px，左侧开关保持固定；原生窗口按钮、折叠与切页不在静态预览中实现。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-shell\"><header class=\"ds-header\"><button class=\"ds-sidebar-toggle\" aria-label=\"收起侧边栏\" title=\"收起侧边栏\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#66737f\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M9 4v16\"/></svg></button></header><nav class=\"ds-nav\"><button class=\"ds-nav-button\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#66737f\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 3v4m8-4v4M4 10h16M8 14h2m4 0h2m-8 4h2\"/></svg><span>时序记录</span></button></nav></div>",
      "css": ".ds-shell{background:#ffffff}.ds-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-sizing:border-box;height:32px;padding:0 156px 0 18px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edef;background:#eff3f4}.ds-sidebar-toggle{box-sizing:content-box;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;flex-shrink:0;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.ds-sidebar-toggle:hover{background:#e2e8f0}.ds-sidebar-toggle:active{background:#e4edf3}.ds-sidebar-toggle:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#7895bc}.ds-nav{background:#eff3f4;padding:16px 14px;width:188px}.ds-nav-button{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei UI\",sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;text-align:left;background:transparent;color:#34404c;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:7px;padding:10px 12px;min-height:20px}.ds-nav-button svg{width:19px;height:19px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav-button:hover{background:#e7edef}.ds-nav-button[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:#e4edf3;color:#41638f;font-weight:600}.ds-nav-button:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#7895bc}"
